  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I just briefly tried the current migration-utils tool on a Fedora3 data set. All fedora \"internal\" objects where handled just fine - as it seems from looking at the OCFL structure. However, the utility refused to actually migrate content objects:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "text": "INFO 07:38:25.294 (Migrator) Processing \"qucosa:34072\"...",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "ERROR 07:38:25.298 (Migrator) MIGRATION_FAILURE: UNREADABLE_OBJECT: message=\"MIGRATION_FAILURE: pid=\"qucosa:34072\", message=\"Unable to resolve internal ID \"qucosa:34072+ATT-0+ATT-0.0\"!\"\"",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "java.lang.RuntimeException: MIGRATION_FAILURE: pid=\"qucosa:34072\", message=\"Unable to resolve internal ID \"qucosa:34072+ATT-0+ATT-0.0\"!\"",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "at org.fcrepo.migration.Migrator.run(Migrator.java:169) ~[migration-utils-6.0.0-SNAPSHOT-driver.jar:na]",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "at org.fcrepo.migration.PicocliMigrator.call(PicocliMigrator.java:269) ~[migration-utils-6.0.0-SNAPSHOT-driver.jar:na]",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "at org.fcrepo.migration.PicocliMigrator.call(PicocliMigrator.java:58) ~[migration-utils-6.0.0-SNAPSHOT-driver.jar:na]",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "at picocli.CommandLine.executeUserObject(CommandLine.java:1743) ~[migration-utils-6.0.0-SNAPSHOT-driver.jar:na]",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "at picocli.CommandLine.access$900(CommandLine.java:145) ~[migration-utils-6.0.0-SNAPSHOT-driver.jar:na]",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "at picocli.CommandLine$RunLast.handle(CommandLine.java:2101) ~[migration-utils-6.0.0-SNAPSHOT-driver.jar:na]",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "at picocli.CommandLine$RunLast.handle(CommandLine.java:2068) ~[migration-utils-6.0.0-SNAPSHOT-driver.jar:na]",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "at picocli.CommandLine$AbstractParseResultHandler.execute(CommandLine.java:1935) ~[migration-utils-6.0.0-SNAPSHOT-driver.jar:na]",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "at picocli.CommandLine.execute(CommandLine.java:1864) ~[migration-utils-6.0.0-SNAPSHOT-driver.jar:na]",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "at org.fcrepo.migration.PicocliMigrator.main(PicocliMigrator.java:149) ~[migration-utils-6.0.0-SNAPSHOT-driver.jar:na]",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "Caused by: java.lang.RuntimeException: Unable to resolve internal ID \"qucosa:34072+ATT-0+ATT-0.0\"!",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "at org.fcrepo.migration.foxml.DirectoryScanningIDResolver.resolveInternalID(DirectoryScanningIDResolver.java:130) ~[migration-utils-6.0.0-SNAPSHOT-driver.jar:na]",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "at org.fcrepo.migration.foxml.FoxmlInputStreamFedoraObjectProcessor$Foxml11DatastreamVersion.<init>(FoxmlInputStreamFedoraObjectProcessor.java:363) ~[migration-utils-6.0.0-SNAPSHOT-driver.jar:na]",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "at org.fcrepo.migration.foxml.FoxmlInputStreamFedoraObjectProcessor.processObject(FoxmlInputStreamFedoraObjectProcessor.java:144) ~[migration-utils-6.0.0-SNAPSHOT-driver.jar:na]",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "at org.fcrepo.migration.Migrator.run(Migrator.java:161) ~[migration-utils-6.0.0-SNAPSHOT-driver.jar:na]",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "... 9 common frames omitted",
         "type": "text"
        }
       ],
       "type": "paragraph"
      }
     ],
     "type": "blockquote"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The objects datastreams show just fine in the running Fedora 3 instance.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
