      "displayName": "Ralf Claussnitzer",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a55c52a3d400690692f7",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Seems to be a user error. I started the migration with: </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">--source-type=legacy</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p> instead of </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">--source-type=akubra</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p> against Fedora 3.8.1.<br/>\nWhen using the Akubra source type everything is fine. Just some OCFL hash errors on objects with fixity problems.</p>\n\n<p>Side note: I noticed a directory \".run\" which is created in the project root when executing the migration in IntelliJ. This should probably be mentioned in the .gitignore file.</p>",
